[chara_hide  name="花知晚"  time="0"  wait="false"  pos_mode="false"  ]
[chara_show  name="鎬衷爾"  time="0"  wait="false"  storage="chara/5/鎬平常小.png"  width="280"  height="350"  left="513"  top="70"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#鎬衷爾
聽說我失蹤的時候，妳整天忙著找我，為了蒐集線索還到處幫人解謎。雖然很感謝，但是我不太懂。[p]
老實說我跟妳並不算很熟，妳為什麼要為我做這麼多？[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[chara_hide  name="鎬衷爾"  time="0"  wait="false"  pos_mode="false"  ]
[chara_show  name="花知晚"  time="0"  wait="false"  storage="chara/1/花驚訝小.png"  width="240"  height="330"  left="150"  top="90"  ]
